      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The pain you feel is so vast it feels like it will consume everything, but that feeling of nothingness is a lie the despair tells you. Your struggle isn't about rebuilding a kingdom; it's about finding a single moment where the hurting lessens, even if it's just for a breath. If the world feels finished, perhaps the only thing left to do is find the one small thing that makes the next minute bearable.",
