    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a lie kaelen, it's the truth. i'm so exhausted from trying to find those \"small things\" when all i can feel is the weight of everything i've lost. it feels like i'm just prolonging the inevitable. why do i have to keep dragging this broken version of myself through the dirt? wouldn't it be more merciful to just let it all rest? to just let the darkness take over so i don't have to feel this anymore?",
